    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\mathrm{LHS}=-\\tan^2\\theta=\\mathrm{RHS}$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{LHS}&=\\frac{\\sin\\theta\\sin\\theta}{-\\cos\\theta\\cos\\theta}\\\\&=\\frac{\\sin^2\\theta}{-\\cos^2\\theta}\\\\&=-\\tan^2\\theta=\\mathrm{RHS}.\\end{aligned}$$",
